# Rules for new sessions in my-gemini-pro

**Project goal:** drive Gemini Deep Research on `gemini.google.com` with cookies from
paid Google AI Pro accounts (via `gemini_webapi` / C# port), never via the AI Studio
Interactions API (separate pay-as-you-go billing).

---

## 0. Repo layout (changed 2026-11-15)

Two independent projects:

| Folder | Language | Role | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| `my-geminiweb-mcp/` | C# / .NET | **MCP Server App** — new direction (official `ModelContextProtocol` SDK) | 🆕 active |
| `my-geminiweb-orchestrator/` | Python | CDP/cookie orchestrator + GUI + CLI + MCP (Python) | 📦 archived, still runs |

**All paths below are relative to `my-geminiweb-orchestrator/`**
unless `my-geminiweb-mcp/` is stated.

