## 6. Standard workflow

```powershell
cd my-geminiweb-orchestrator

# Current cookie state
python scripts\scan_browser_cookies.py

# Validate configured pools
python scripts\setup_pool.py validate

# One real probe sentence
python scripts\setup_pool.py probe

# Live harvest + auto re-login when a session dies
python -m orchestrator.orch_cli harvest all
```

Web-lane health from any repo (no harvest needed):

```
gemini_check      # via MCP gemini-web
gemini_bridge     # endpoint + token for the extension
```

