## 7. Verifying a `gemini_webapi` claim

Read the real source, **never** guess:

```powershell
$src = "$env:TEMP\gemini-webapi\src\gemini_webapi"
# if not cloned yet:
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API.git "$env:TEMP\gemini-webapi"

rg -n "deep_research|_assert_deep_research_capable|inspect_account_status" $src
rg -n "GRPC\.|DEEP_RESEARCH" "$src\constants.py"
```

For the C# port the source of truth is
`my-geminiweb-mcp/my-geminiweb-mcp/Gemini/` (`GeminiWebClient.cs`, `FileTransfer.cs`).

